<h2>The map</h2>
<p>A Leaflet map with toggleable flood-hazard data collated from the sea-level-rise and coastal-flooding tools that have publicly accessible endpoints. Use this when you want to compare different layers and scenarios for a specific piece of California coastline. Not every one of the 12 tools appears here — see the comparison page for the full list.</p>
<a class="landing-card-cta" href="{{ '/map.html' | url }}">Open the map</a>
