<img src="{{ '/img/preview-sources.png' | url }}" alt="Screenshot of the CA Sea Change Atlas tool comparison page" loading="lazy" onerror="this.remove()">
<h2>Tool comparison</h2>
<p>A filterable grid of all 12 sea-level-rise and coastal-flooding tools California residents and planners might use, plus a compare-up-to-three table covering scope, process, exposure, data, and known limitations. Use this when you're deciding which tool is the right one for your question in the first place.</p>
<a class="landing-card-cta" href="{{ '/sources.html' | url }}">Browse the 12 tools</a>
